            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.99</h2>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 4px">Voice and preview</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Eleven v4 voices.</b> Eleven v4 is the default voice model, v4 Turbo is new for faster results, and voice generation costs less.</li>
<li><b>Previews after Dual-Screen.</b> Video previews no longer stay black with sound playing after you leave Dual-Screen.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
